{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/447473-an-anime-called-aria","id":447473,"title":"An anime called Aria?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-18T04:16:53-07:00","id":447473,"title":"An anime called Aria?","content":"Just a simple question here -<br /> On page 311 of the original Aeon/Trinity core sourcebook, the list of suggested source material includes a recommended Anime called 'Aria'. The blurb decribes it with the following:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Space travel, neat looking weapons and armor, and the main enemy is an Aberrant! </div> </div> </div>Now, i'm not really a 100% Anime nerd (i estimate myself a 20-30% anime nerd tops -smile-), but the only title i could ever find with this name was produced years after the book was published and doesn't actually have any weapons/armor or enemies in it (at least as far as i can tell).<br /> Does anybody know what this recommendation refers to? I would love to see what the original setting is drawing from on this topic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T06:24:07-07:00","id":447614,"title":"","content":"Is it this? <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aria_%28manga%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aria_%28manga%29</a><br /> <br /> I have no idea, I'm not into manga / anime at all, but a quick google turned that up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T06:52:21-07:00","id":447641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CHILL</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/447473-an-anime-called-aria?p=447614#post447614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it this? <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aria_%28manga%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aria_%28manga%29</a><br /> <br /> I have no idea, I'm not into manga / anime at all, but a quick google turned that up.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the other Aria Nihilist found (being produced after the original corebook came out), not the one they're looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T08:01:30-07:00","id":447703,"title":"","content":"Thanks, both.<br /> The link provided is indeed for the Anime produced after the Trinity book was produced. I know Max can time travel, but surely the devs couldn't.<br /> -smile-","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T14:56:21-07:00","id":448313,"title":"","content":"I believe they meant Iria (<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iria:_Zeiram_the_Animation\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iria:_Zeiram_the_Animation</a>). Back in those day the most common version of this anime in the states was an old fan sub that got the name wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T22:25:19-07:00","id":448864,"title":"","content":"Excellent suggestion, Slapheap. I'll see if i can find it about for inspection.<br /> -thumbs ups-","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T19:54:03-07:00","id":499680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Slagheap</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/447473-an-anime-called-aria?p=448313#post448313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe they meant Iria (<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iria:_Zeiram_the_Animation\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iria:_Zeiram_the_Animation</a>). Back in those day the most common version of this anime in the states was an old fan sub that got the name wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn, i was going to say exactly the same thing - for some reason title &amp; description screamed Iria/Zeiram to me the moment i read it. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2QYdyTBf2Jk\" target=\"_blank\">Great series indeed</a>.<br /> As a aside, there's a <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iria:_Zeiram_the_Animation\" target=\"_blank\">Zeiram live action film </a>the Iria OVAs are supposed to be a prequel to.<br /> Not quite as awesome from what i remember, i felt it was worth mentioning for reference.<br /> <br /> As an aside, though totally unrelated story-wise, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DNA%C2%B2\" target=\"_blank\">DNA<sup><span style=\"font-size:8px\">2</span></sup></a> and <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zetman\" target=\"_blank\">Zetman</a> are two other series with sci-fi/superhero elements of the same writer, artist and character designer of the anime adaptations, Masakazu Katsura, so they might be worth checking out for a bunch of visuals and hooks to adapt and mine, though pretty different genre-wise (DNA<sup>2</sup> in particular being more of a romantic comedy/parody).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 05-01-2015, 11:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}